  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support the Recipient&apos;s efforts to reduce transport costs along the road corridor from Monroviato the Guinea border and to maintain the road in good condition over a 10-year period.</narrative>
  </description>
